{"id":"a0dd416b6d08d4e339d32bb8f2225f0330453036","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1242205","title":"Deepseek V4.1 Flash 与 Gemini 3.8 Flash 难分伯仲 ？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"ixixi","excerpt":"程序员 - @ixixi - 很难说谁更好，各位和我一样的感觉吗 ？","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18088895\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2d53/5f8a/94728_normal.png?m=1782356162\" alt=\"rwecho\" data-uid=\"94728\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/rwecho\">rwecho</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 18:14:42 +08:00\">22h 3m ago via iPad</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我感觉 v41 好一点</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18088939\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5c3b/d976/405428_normal.png?m=1768658555\" alt=\"zisen\" data-uid=\"405428\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zisen\">zisen</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 18:25:00 +08:00\">21h 52m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>v41 喜欢闷头干，一句话也不说自己干 50 分钟，结果发现一个已经记录到文档里的结论，还喜欢自己做实验，用的 zcode ，不知道是不是 harness 的问题，gemini 前端的神</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18089060\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a8e5a873829e265b793a9ef8e7811300?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"PrinceofInj\" data-uid=\"547559\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/PrinceofInj\">PrinceofInj</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 18:58:24 +08:00\">21h 19m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我给了一份服务端的文档，然后让他写一个网关客户端。这家伙上来就直接拿这份文档写了一个模拟服务器，然后再写的客户端。因为反应很快，等我发现已经来不及了，他已经把服务端写好了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18089113\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d4b3/191c/386079_normal.png?m=1782990417\" alt=\"tianjiyao\" data-uid=\"386079\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/tianjiyao\">tianjiyao</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 19:15:05 +08:00\">21h 2m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>Gemini 3.8 Flash 的套餐很便宜啊 13 块钱人民币。。额度都蹬不完。。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18089376\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/36ddfd59240aa92949fbe9c62536658f?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"canyue7897\" data-uid=\"336766\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/canyue7897\">canyue7897</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 20:46:31 +08:00\">19h 31m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>gemini 3.8 flash 感觉效果好多了。目前在用，爽的飞起。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18089977\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3acd/5809/429891_normal.png?m=1716195208\" alt=\"idragonet\" data-uid=\"429891\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/idragonet\">idragonet</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-16 08:05:56 +08:00\">8h 11m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>Gemini Pro 便宜 18 个月印度算下来 1 个月 0.5 元。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18091700\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/efd3/02e2/229404_normal.png?m=1787407289\" alt=\"zizon\" data-uid=\"229404\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zizon\">zizon</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-16 12:52:32 +08:00\">3h 25m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>Gemini 还是超前很多的.<br>Deepseek 目前只是速度上稍微没掉队,多模态能力还很基础.</p><p>Gemini 已经是全力冲刺多模态实时 reasoning 了.</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18092259\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/4a2efb2f700231c3549fe637940fb831?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"qianyeyixi\" data-uid=\"558828\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n  